        "parms": "# bag — the notes held down\nA bag holds a set of numbers. Its right inlet is a flag: while it is not 0, numbers on the left inlet are added, and while it is 0 they are removed. A list of a number and a flag sets the flag and applies the number in one go. Adding and removing send nothing; a bang sends every number held, one at a time, newest first. A number is held at most once, unless the bag has an argument. The contents are not saved with the patch.",
